<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">using<sp/>namespace<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">micro_test_plus::operators;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
